| Component     | Role                                                                                                                                    |
| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **LangChain** | User asks: "Show me vegetarian pizza under ₹300." LangChain searches menu database and generates the answer.                            |
| **LangGraph** | One agent checks menu, another agent checks offers, another confirms stock, another calculates total, then final response is generated. |
